AdminUserLookupPhone.description:
The full phone number to look up, normalised as in BR-ID-05 细则「手机号规范化」 (not a
mainland mobile number → 20001 with data.fields=[phone] and data.reason=phone_invalid);
give exactly one of uid and phone.

AdminClaimQuery.description:
A claim_id, the order number as submitted, or a child order number, matched exactly.
Trimmed and with spaces removed, then 1–64 characters, else 20001 with data.fields=[q];
the bound is checked after trimming, so the schema carries none.

AdminConfigVersionNumber.description:
Version of the key's current value: 0 = never written (value null, the default applies);
plus 1 on every change or rollback, never going back. The CAS value `expected_version`
of the writes.
